{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "0cadb0ccd724eae7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阪木「哈哈哈哈！\\n這裡就是我的藏身之處！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_06",
      "hash": "0cadadccd724e5ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我本打算在火箭隊復活\\n的那天到來之前，\\r\\n先在這座道館重整旗鼓！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_07",
      "hash": "0cadaeccd724e781",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不過……\\n既然被[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳發現我藏身於此，\\r\\n那就沒辦法了！\\r\\n這次我是不會手下留情的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_08",
      "hash": "0cada7ccd724db9c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那麼……就讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳再嚐一次！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_09",
      "hash": "0cada8ccd724dd4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "最強的寶可夢訓練家，\\n我阪木的厲害！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "A_TRID_GYM08_01_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "5a96627c1c6029ab",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "0cadb1ccd724ec9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳贏了！\\c\\n為了證明[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的勝利，\\n我就把這個綠色徽章交給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8070_sys_01",
      "hash": "024f6b4339ba2b93",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從阪木那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]綠色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_03",
      "hash": "0cadb2ccd724ee4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要擁有綠色徽章，\\n所有的寶可夢……\\c\\n無論初訓家是何人，\\n無論寶可夢等級多高，\\r\\n都會聽命於[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_10",
      "hash": "0cb0b5ccd727293d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "它能證明[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳已經是一個\\n能夠獨當一面的訓練家了！\\c\\n這樣一來，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就能挑戰寶可夢聯盟了吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_11",
      "hash": "0cb0b4ccd727278a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還有這個招式學習器……！\\n就給將要挑戰寶可夢聯盟的[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\r\\n當作餞別之禮吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8070_sys_02",
      "hash": "024f6c4339ba2d46",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從阪木那裡\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n「[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_04",
      "hash": "0cadabccd724e268",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器41是「地震」！\\n這個招式會讓地面強烈搖晃，\\r\\n進而對敵人造成巨大傷害！\\r\\n威力非常強大！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_12",
      "hash": "0cb0b3ccd72725d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這個其實……是我過去\\n還在這裡管理道館時\\r\\n做出來的東西……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_05",
      "hash": "0cadacccd724e41b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "今天我這樣輸給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n我已沒有辦法向部下交代了！\\c\\n火箭隊……\\n從今天起正式解散！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_13",
      "hash": "0cb0b2ccd7272424",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我決定從頭再來一次\\n寶可夢的修行！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main8070_rocketboss_14",
      "hash": "0cb0b1ccd7272271",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希望有一天……\\n我們還有機會見面！\\r\\n……再會了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_08_07",
      "hash": "0f9eb2d6a81ace20",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8070_max",
      "hash": "966942d8e2229ed0"
    }
  ]
